WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.858
First, describe the video you want to make, then put ambient sound and
music in separate fields.

00:00:10.917 --> 00:00:20.565
Reference settings are available too, but supported media and their
effects depend on the model and pipeline.

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:30.576
Videos, pictures and audio are gathered in one place so you can find the
media you need.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:41.500
Play the two clips in sequence to check the order of the scenes and the
overall pacing.

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:53.852
Here, you can adjust playback speed, volume and how the two clips connect.

00:00:54.917 --> 00:01:03.891
This is a tour of the interface; not every effect was applied and
verified.
